{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "ec5f2a1f32bc53fcc487868c8d87554846af9d16f6cba107fda7f5d0f421eb06", "ja": "勝負はこれから！", "zh": "决胜负才刚要开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "83b05b8c008bdefcd748c39f39772e9a7291ce3e0d22b052267861775feaad79", "ja": "全力を出し切りへとへとのアイドルたちの前\nに現れたプロデューサーは、なぜか水着姿。\n社長の発案で、今から豪華賞品をかけた\n『765プロ水上納涼会』が開催されると聞\nき、アイドルたちは目を輝かせるのだった。", "zh": "在拼尽全力、累得精疲力竭的偶像们面前，\n制作人不知为何穿着泳装出现了。\n听说在社长的提议下，从现在开始将举办一场\n以豪华奖品为赌注的“765制作人水上纳凉会”，\n偶像们的双眼顿时闪闪发亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "1f1491d32e2920c3d46ecd08bb6e7ca33c163309b64c30ae9143d9badeed82eb", "ja": "あーあ、終わっちゃった……。\nもっとやりたかったな～。", "zh": "啊——结束了……  \n还想再玩一会儿的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "1c673641e59897b728254532ac06adbd0360a226f5d06becdbcbbabfe5fafadb", "ja": "さすが、ウミミンは元気だね～。茜ちゃんも\n元気だけど～、体力的には限界デス……。", "zh": "不愧是海美，真有精神呢～。小茜也\n很有精神，不过体力已经到极限了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2a81ebef9cec5498309e1657270a04339325c82ae51bfb75402f7ef702c4237a", "ja": "私は精神的にも限界です……。\n力の限りを、出し尽くしました……。", "zh": "我的精神也已经到极限了……已经竭尽全力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b322ce121774565618a668c12086a4700a4e7e6130de4512abfdfe16ac1dd882", "ja": "二人とも本当にお疲れ様！\n水に入ってると、思った以上に体力を使うもんね。", "zh": "你们两个真的辛苦了！\n泡在水里比想象中更消耗体力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "4b14a2476c38b3eade4f253cb4c33455962d2bcadc5c58b3c75a3e0cdc4ec31f", "ja": "でもどの競技も楽しかったよな～！\nお客さんも盛り上がってたし！", "zh": "不过每项比赛都很开心啊～！\n客人们也都玩得很尽兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "a60e459e6da9b4ee142009fa9f712b6dba927b277a928dec56ba94cdedcc65ad", "ja": "水風船も、すっごく喜んでもらえましたね！\nえへへ、よかった～♪", "zh": "水气球也让大家特别开心呢！\n嘿嘿，太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "7e21dc5c0b6c9c909fda9ab462480413dcfa5559e298c11669909b1151d227e7", "ja": "……で、なんで茜ちゃんたち、ここにいるんだっけ？\nもうあとは帰るだけだよね？", "zh": "……话说回来，小茜们为什么会在这里来着？\n接下来不就只剩下回去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6562c43ce6e83cab209f80ae5540988384d24334abf6761608f9b0f60c583060", "ja": "えっと、{$P$}さんが\nここに集合してくれって言ってたんだけど……、え！？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生说让我们到这里集合……诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ae8f72af54acf94651236c40a4e815e776fda2934f25a778e7dd4305e6a5fd33", "ja": "ごめんみんな、遅くなった！", "zh": "抱歉各位，我来晚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "ea1f24af32b31aaa5f8f314df4026fd86ccb219db1b482b8d7a9a604fa747ab4", "ja": "って、{$P$}ちゃん！？\nその恰好は……？", "zh": "等等，{$P$}！？你这身打扮是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e6d4213c565b046c79411d0341ea903e889b028e0b1f154fa92669696fb9428e", "ja": "あ、あなたはなぜ、水着なのですか！？", "zh": "啊，你为什么穿着泳装！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ad04211f3c1c5d85a73f42824681aa66b1a9d5815436461b6d8dda2a00dbbabd", "ja": "いやぁ、じつは社長の発案で。今日はこのまま、\nここで『765プロ水上納涼会』を開催するぞ！", "zh": "哎呀，其实是社长提议的。今天就这么\n直接在这里举办“765艺能水上纳凉会”吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "a46d1b43ac9d734ca2c46ab74d930f706dd0ddf2a25cee19e0feac30136637cd", "ja": "765プロ、水上納涼会～？", "zh": "765艺能，水上纳凉会～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c615b024251cc961f60538dd6be225ca020730e4c7fdfeb3cd1a5d8dda0cfd53", "ja": "すぐ社長と音無さん、青羽さんも合流予定だ。\n豪華賞品をかけたゲームとかも用意してある！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐和青羽小姐也马上就要来汇合了。  \n还准备了以豪华奖品为赌注的游戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "87ada01ca02c83ecf00dfe84832ff1467e2d59c6526d9f3462c0aa4ea92ed22e", "ja": "それってつまり……\n運動会延長戦、ってことだよねっ！？", "zh": "也就是说……这就是运动会加时赛，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c8fb0da8fd0b87315de652b00fe931e2860a7255c405419f3c9ef9902c249cc5", "ja": "まあ、そんなところかな。\nみんなは疲れてるだろうけど……。", "zh": "嗯，差不多就是这样吧。大家应该都累了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "5af710e2bdcb37cd9c9a7ec3cff1c649a356c850bd79f4d4ed11dc5db02b2cd9", "ja": "おおっと！　そういうことなら話は別だよ♪\n茜ちゃん完全復活！　待ってろ豪華賞品～☆", "zh": "哦哦！既然是这样，那可就另当别论啦♪  \n小茜完全复活！等着拿豪华奖品吧～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "2e0050b09dd93d0b057d8e0924811da1d3957358de06fc54220d42e7ee9f9884", "ja": "マジか！　面白そうじゃん♪　そのゲームってさ、\n{$P$}達も参加するのか？", "zh": "真的吗！听起来很有意思嘛♪　那个游戏呢，\n{$P$}他们也会参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6e7e2e32656a652c8f4dabc2a0a70ed7e6e17dd74d1d84f74592243157651e88", "ja": "ああ。みんなには俺たちとも戦ってもらう。\n悪いが……やるからには、手加減しないからな！", "zh": "啊。大家也得和我们较量。\n抱歉……既然要打，我可不会手下留情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "34a9e4c8aab78ad145481b801e15c6752176ac82fda830527a7077458c8d8386", "ja": "疲労困憊の私達に、大人げもなく本気で挑むとは……！\nいいでしょう。むしろ闘志が湧いてきました！！", "zh": "竟然对疲惫不堪的我们也毫不顾忌地认真挑战……！\n好吧。反倒让我燃起斗志了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1ac93320dd872487e670f03f2db0d440b8bbb292ed1029636adf1d48c7a42815", "ja": "ふふっ、いいですよ？\nこっちこそ、手加減なんかしてあげませんからね♪", "zh": "呵呵，当然可以呀？\n我们这边才不会手下留情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "47960bbb2c0363292b55d32246b95cec23da7051941b30d9cdbba3685e593c1d", "ja": "豪華賞品かぁ～。中身はなにかなぁ～♪\n楽しみだなぁ～。豪華なパンケーキかなぁ？", "zh": "豪华奖品啊～。里面会是什么呢～♪好期待啊～。会不会是豪华松饼呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "2479afc490d53ad8cfbd6f6e34785525df520c02d2e695594a0d65e020341ba9", "ja": "うう～っ　楽しくなってきた～っ！\n私、我慢できないから、ちょっと先に泳いでくるね！！", "zh": "呜呜～越想越兴奋了～！\n我都忍不住了，先去游一会哦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "54597ef8845614c85f48f05a8fe35a6b0527d0d6026452610a78fc8d86ea039d", "ja": "海美！？　そんな、貴重な体力を消費して\n自らハンデを背負わなくても……海美ー！！", "zh": "海美！？没必要消耗宝贵的体力，主动给自己增加 handicap……海美——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "49f6dee128a7c956b22005254367325b54ef01bcd401c16434f01979c4b74154", "ja": "みんなもおいでよ～！　水の中だと、身体も軽いよ～！", "zh": "大家也快过来呀～！在水里的话，身体也会变轻哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0390_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0390_story_06_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "4be9535cfd0acc86394fe6f4ddbc536894041910d760c211e8395075342444ea", "ja": "ううう～、やっぱり！　夏ってサイコーーー☆", "zh": "唔唔唔～，果然！夏天太棒啦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
